-- 1357: Blog post -- "Agentic AI for Social Media Marketing: Running the Facebook Campaign Loop with AI Agents".
-- Focus: the five-stage Facebook loop (plan/create/measure/optimise/community) run by agents,
-- what stays human (budget, brand voice, complaints), and the guardrails.
-- Funnels to WSQ Agentic AI for Social Media Marketing (TGS-2020505996), SG-only.
-- Published live (status=1), BACK-DATED to 2025-06-05 per the admin's "date all the digital
-- marketing blogs in Apr to Aug 2025" (post 8 of 16, WSQ/CASL digital marketing batch).
--
-- BACK-DATED => linkedin_urn / facebook_post_id = 'manual-skip' so publishDue's share
-- step permanently no-ops (standing rule, blog-pipeline SKILL.md "Hard-won rules").
--
-- All external + course URLs verified HTTP 200 on 2026-09-07.
--
-- NOTE: hero_image_url is NULL here by design -- generate the hero ON PROD after
